  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nHero armor -0.08 per talent.
    Every heart collected during the run gives this ally 2% reach, up to 20%, applied
    when the next battle is prepared.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nCompanions / Companion
    size: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging
    three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA tide-born
    resident who remembers the moon before the sea acquired a ceiling. Their migration
    follows a pull no map records. They want to discover whether the older sea survives
    and whether their young can reach it.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic
    personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their
    stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: astral, hare. Immortal.
    Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless
    the talent forbids it."
